  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The Wind**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Weed Whore**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Gladiola Heartbreaker**: rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **Purple Rain**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **Stacy**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1991-03-04.sbd.flac16** (recommended): soundboard; 17 songs; 55 min; rated 2.5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Peter Davis of Creature Booking booked the show together with Jill Fonaas, Twin/Tone Records' publicity and promotion rep [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1991-03-04.sbd.flac16**: taped by Kirk Miller; transferred by mrdna; source: SBD [1]. Also: The reviewer made the soundboard capture, with clearance from Jill Fonaas of Twin/Tone Records, and still holds the original cassette as of 2022; The reviewer may have traded the cassette copy years ago, which is probably how it reached circulation; Frequency and spectral analysis indicate the FLAC files are lossless; file names were converted to etree standard on 1/22/06 [1][3]",
